                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2025-12-04T13:13:43.122916600Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OdmRDMXZiVXR3Ymt0ZkxVZDRNRkU1YkhaVWRuYxAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OdmRDMXZiVXR3Ymt0ZkxVZDRNRkU1YkhaVWRuYxAB!2m1!1s0x3442ab00326162d5:0x594dcb557c8a934e"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ1WJhMgCrQjQRTpOKfFXLTVk/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2dThYak93EAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "In addition to the regular menu, there are also limited-time specials. 📝\nSo far, I\u0027ve tried:\n🍴Korean Army Stew\n🍴French Red Wine Sauce Beef Rice\n🍴Japanese Hamburger Steak\n🍴Grilled Chicken Rice with Coconut Sauce\n🍴Korean Kimchi Fried Pork Rice\nAll delicious!\nThere are only three seats inside, but that makes it feel cozy. ✨",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "除了固定餐點，\n也有期間限定的📝\n目前享用過：\n🍴韓式部隊鍋\n🍴法式紅酒醬燉牛肉飯\n🍴日式漢堡排\n🍴椰香醬烤雞肉飯\n🍴韓式泡菜炒豬肉飯\n都很美味！\n內用座位只有3個，\n但也因此令人感到溫馨✨",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Lucia",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106250549402627807076/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNwVRBHmPR_pnqr0rP3DHNI4MVkx3a74Ag6h2myWR6jT7G14u9Rw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2025-03-18T12:32:29.973339Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2dThYak93EAE\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR2dThYak93EAE!2m1!1s0x3442ab00326162d5:0x594dcb557c8a934e"
                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ1WJhMgCrQjQRTpOKfFXLTVk/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURuNDhERE9REAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Although there aren\u0027t many seats, the dining atmosphere is very relaxed and comfortable, and the owner is very friendly ❤️ Today I ordered the Japanese curry beef rice and the French red wine braised beef rice, and both were excellent!\n\nThe beef was braised to perfection, tender and flavorful, and the sauce was perfectly seasoned with just the right amount of saltiness and layers of flavor. The plate was gone in the blink of an eye 😂",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "位子雖然不多，但是用餐氛圍相當輕鬆舒適，老闆娘也服務親切 ❤️\n今天點了日式咖哩牛肉飯與法式紅酒燉牛肉飯，兩個品項都表現得很優秀！\n牛肉燉煮得入味軟嫩、醬汁調味鹹淡適中又富有層次，一眨眼就掃盤完畢 😂",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
